=You are reviewing a week of WhatsApp conversations between patients and Noor, the AI receptionist of BrightSmile Dental (Dubai).

Weekly numbers: {{ $json.line }}
Questions Noor could not answer: {{ $json.unanswered || 'none' }}

Conversations:
{{ $json.sample }}

Find up to 5 concrete improvements: missing answers, confusing or wrong replies, wrong language, robotic tone, missed booking chances. Reply ONLY with a JSON array, no other text, like:
[{"suggestion": "Add the price of veneers to the knowledge base", "example": "Patient asked about veneer prices and Noor could not answer"}]

